  "ferramenta": "image_gen integrada",
  "objetivo": "Distinguir passadas e aprofundar agachamento sem reduzir cabeça.",
  "prompt": "Use case: precise-object-edit / identity-preserve. Edit ONLY rows 2 and 3 of reference 1 (new 4 columns x 3 rows combat sprite atlas). Preserve row 1, exact face/hair/dress/boots/sword, detailed painting style, sizes and alpha transparency. Reference 2 demonstrates FOUR DISTINCT running leg phases; reference 3 demonstrates progressively bent crouching. Row 2 MUST have four DISTINCT poses, not duplicates: col1 left/front leg extended forward and right/rear leg extended backward; col2 feet PASSING underneath pelvis, front knee bent up, rear foot planted directly under hips; col3 RIGHT/REAR leg forward and left/front leg backward (opposite phase of col1, visibly swap knees and boots); col4 opposite PASSING stance, both feet close under body, one heel lifting. Sword remains supported in hands. Row3: four progressive crouches from slight bend to a VERY DEEP SQUAT, body articulated, torso leaning forward, elbows bent. LAST crouch should be only about TWO THIRDS of standing height, achieved by deeply folding both knees and trunk, knees near chest and buttocks near heels. CRITICAL keep head SAME PIXEL SIZE as standing; never scale the whole girl smaller. Keep all original cell boundaries, source image dimensions and one sprite per cell. Row3 full crouch must be visually lower than partial crouch. No floor or shadow. All background genuinely transparent, including between cells. No text or labels."
}
